OL,3,GNEWSAPolice make hare coursing pledge
OL,4,Aamid farmer fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice have pledged to tackle concerns
OL,7,Fover hare coursing "head on" after
OL,8,Ffears were raised by farmers and
OL,9,Fcouncillors.
OL,11,FThe National Farmers' Union (NFU)
OL,12,Fissued a call for help last week,
OL,13,Ffollowing reports of altercations with
OL,14,F"nasty" and "violent" individuals in
OL,15,FNorthumberland.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
