OL,3,GNEWSAPolice make hare coursing pledge
OL,4,Aamid farmer fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FHare coursing involves dogs being used
OL,7,Fto chase, catch and kill hares. Some
OL,8,Ffarmers in the county said they had
OL,9,Ffaced threats from offenders, while
OL,10,FNorthumberland County Council leader
OL,11,FGlen Sanderson described the
OL,12,Fperpetrators as "bloodthirsty".
OL,14,FNorthumbria Police told the Local
OL,15,FDemocracy Reporting Service it had
OL,16,Fseized several vehicles and sent out
OL,17,Fwarning letters following a spate of
OL,18,Freports.
